# Secrets for sites in commons. Prefix every name with its site (CAL_, ...).
# Never use generic names like DATABASE_URL here. See AGENTS.md.

# Lets support/neon/neon-db.mjs create each site's database and fill in its
# connection strings. Use an organization API key, which org members can share: Neon console →
# your organization → Settings → API keys. A personal key (Settings → Personal
# API keys) reaches your whole Neon account. See support/neon/README.md.
NEON_API_KEY=""

# Vercel token (support/vercel/README.md). Create at https://vercel.com/account/tokens
VERCEL_TOKEN=""
# Our resulting website: 
# Our local dev: http://localhost:3000
